+- Prefer projects with active maintenance, clear documentation, and reproducible setup instructions.
+
+## How To Submit
+
+1. Fork the repository.
+2. Add the new tool in the most relevant category in `README.md`.
+3. Use this format:
+
+```md
+#### [Tool Name](https://github.com/username/repo)
+> **Description:** Short README-based summary with what it does, key features, license, stars, language, and activity details.
