+# Best Open Source AI Automation Tools 2026
+
+[![Awesome](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sindresorhus/awesome@main/media/badge.svg)](https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome)
+[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
+![Topics](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/GagnDeep/awesome-best-open-source-ai-automation-tools-2026?style=social)
+
+> This curated list of the best open source AI automation tools for 2026 focuses only on public GitHub repositories. It is designed for builders who want self-hosted workflows, agentic automation, RPA, MCP integrations, and code automation without relying on proprietary SaaS lock-in.
+
+This repository uses the supplied GitHub research snapshot dated March 30, 2026. Every listed project has a `github.com` URL. Where the supplied research did not include a per-repository commit timestamp, the entry calls that out directly instead of inventing a date.
